# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What Docker may see when building the service image.
#
# Docker sends the whole build folder -- the project -- to the engine before
# building. Without this file that would include mlops_env/ (gigabytes),
# data/, .git/, and .dvc/config.local, which holds a local path with the
# Windows username.
#
# So this is an ALLOW-LIST: ignore everything ("*"), then let back in only
# what the service needs. Anything new added to the project later stays out
# by default -- the safe direction to fail in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*

!requirements-serving.txt
!configs/
!src/

# ...but never Python's cache files, even inside src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
